Q: Preloading Google Fonts A: <p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;html lang=&quot;id&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;head&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;!-- Menambahkan meta viewport agar halaman responsif di perangkat seluler --&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;link rel=&quot;preconnect&quot; href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;link rel=&quot;preconnect&quot; href=&quot;https://fonts.gstatic.com&quot; crossorigin&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;link href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Permanent+Marker&amp;family=Caveat:wght@700&amp;family=Kalam:wght@700&amp;family=Shadows+Into+Light+Two&amp;display=swap&quot; rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;title&gt;Mockup Baju Angkatan - BRAVE&lt;/title&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;style&gt;</p>
<p>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }</p>
<p>body {</p>
<pre><code>font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;

background: #f3f1ec;

min-height: 100vh;

display: flex;

flex-direction: column;

align-items: center;

padding: 32px 16px 60px;

color: #1c1c1c;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; text-align: center; }</p>
<p>p.sub { color: #6b6b6b; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; }</p>
<p>/* Area utama penampung mockup dan panel kontrol */</p>
<p>.main-container {</p>
<pre><code>display: flex;

flex-direction: column;

align-items: center;

gap: 24px;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>.stage {</p>
<pre><code>position: relative;

width: 340px;

height: 420px;

border-radius: 18px;

background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #ffffff 0%, #e7e4dd 100%);

box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);

display: flex;

align-items: center;

justify-content: center;

overflow: hidden;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>.shirt-canvas { position: relative; width: 300px; height: 386px; }</p>
<p>.shirt-layer {</p>
<pre><code>position: absolute;

inset: 0;

-webkit-mask-size: contain;

mask-size: contain;

-webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;

mask-repeat: no-repeat;

-webkit-mask-position: center;

mask-position: center;

transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>#shirtBase {</p>
<pre><code>/\* Menggunakan background-color default hitam agar masker biner dasar kaos terlihat jelas \*/

background-color: #1a1a1a; 

-webkit-mask-image: url('data:image/png;base64,');
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>/* Elemen desain cetak teks di atas kaos */</p>
<p>.shirt-design {</p>
<pre><code>position: absolute;

top: 35%;

left: 50%;

transform: translate(-50%, -50%);

width: 80%;

text-align: center;

pointer-events: none; /\* Supaya input tidak mengganggu hover/klik \*/

user-select: none;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>/* Gaya dasar teks &quot;BRAVE&quot; */</p>
<p>#designText {</p>
<pre><code>font-family: 'Permanent Marker', sans-serif;

font-size: 36px;

color: #ffffff;

text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);

transition: all 0.3s ease;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>/* Panel kontrol interaktif */</p>
<p>.control-panel {</p>
<pre><code>background: #ffffff;

padding: 20px;

border-radius: 14px;

box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);

width: 340px;

display: flex;

flex-direction: column;

gap: 16px;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>.control-group {</p>
<pre><code>display: flex;

flex-direction: column;

gap: 8px;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>label {</p>
<pre><code>font-size: 13px;

font-weight: 600;

color: #4a4a4a;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>/* Kustomisasi pilihan warna instan */</p>
<p>.color-pickers {</p>
<pre><code>display: flex;

gap: 10px;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>.color-btn {</p>
<pre><code>width: 32px;

height: 32px;

border-radius: 50%;

border: 2px solid transparent;

cursor: pointer;

box-shadow: inset 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);

transition: transform 0.2s;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>.color-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }</p>
<p>.color-btn.active { border-color: #1c1c1c; }</p>
<p>select, input[type=&quot;text&quot;] {</p>
<pre><code>width: 100%;

padding: 10px;

border: 1px solid #ddd;

border-radius: 8px;

font-size: 14px;

outline: none;

background-color: #fafafa;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>&lt;/style&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;/head&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;body&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;h1&gt;Mockup Baju Angkatan - BRAVE&lt;/h1&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;p class=&quot;sub&quot;&gt;Sesuaikan warna kain dan tipe tulisan desain kaos angkatan Anda&lt;/p&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;div class=&quot;main-container&quot;&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;!-- Area Preview Mockup --&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;div class=&quot;stage&quot;&gt;</p>
<pre><code>\&lt;div class=&quot;shirt-canvas&quot;\&gt;

  \&lt;div id=&quot;shirtBase&quot; class=&quot;shirt-layer&quot;\&gt;\&lt;/div\&gt;

  \&lt;div class=&quot;shirt-design&quot;\&gt;

    \&lt;div id=&quot;designText&quot;\&gt;BRAVE\&lt;/div\&gt;

  \&lt;/div\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;!-- Panel Kontrol Pengguna --&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;div class=&quot;control-panel&quot;&gt;</p>
<pre><code>\&lt;!-- Pilihan Warna Kaos --\&gt;

\&lt;div class=&quot;control-group&quot;\&gt;

  \&lt;label\&gt;Warna Bahan Kaos:\&lt;/label\&gt;

  \&lt;div class=&quot;color-pickers&quot;\&gt;

    \&lt;button class=&quot;color-btn active&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #1a1a1a;&quot; onclick=&quot;changeColor('#1a1a1a', this)&quot;\&gt;\&lt;/button\&gt;

    \&lt;button class=&quot;color-btn&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #9a1f1f;&quot; onclick=&quot;changeColor('#9a1f1f', this)&quot;\&gt;\&lt;/button\&gt;

    \&lt;button class=&quot;color-btn&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #1f4e9a;&quot; onclick=&quot;changeColor('#1f4e9a', this)&quot;\&gt;\&lt;/button\&gt;

    \&lt;button class=&quot;color-btn&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #1f9a55;&quot; onclick=&quot;changeColor('#1f9a55', this)&quot;\&gt;\&lt;/button\&gt;

    \&lt;button class=&quot;color-btn&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: inset 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);&quot; onclick=&quot;changeColor('#ffffff', this)&quot;\&gt;\&lt;/button\&gt;

  \&lt;/div\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;

\&lt;!-- Edit Teks Desain --\&gt;

\&lt;div class=&quot;control-group&quot;\&gt;

  \&lt;label for=&quot;textInput&quot;\&gt;Ubah Teks Nama Angkatan:\&lt;/label\&gt;

  \&lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;textInput&quot; value=&quot;BRAVE&quot; oninput=&quot;updateText(this.value)&quot;\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;

\&lt;!-- Pilihan Jenis Font Google Fonts --\&gt;

\&lt;div class=&quot;control-group&quot;\&gt;

  \&lt;label for=&quot;fontSelect&quot;\&gt;Gaya Font Desain:\&lt;/label\&gt;

  \&lt;select id=&quot;fontSelect&quot; onchange=&quot;changeFont(this.value)&quot;\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;'Permanent Marker', sans-serif&quot;\&gt;Permanent Marker\&lt;/option\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;'Caveat', cursive&quot;\&gt;Caveat\&lt;/option\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;'Kalam', cursive&quot;\&gt;Kalam\&lt;/option\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;'Shadows Into Light Two', cursive&quot;\&gt;Shadows Into Light Two\&lt;/option\&gt;

  \&lt;/select\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;

\&lt;!-- Pilihan Warna Sablon/Teks --\&gt;

\&lt;div class=&quot;control-group&quot;\&gt;

  \&lt;label for=&quot;textColor&quot;\&gt;Warna Sablon Tulisan:\&lt;/label\&gt;

  \&lt;select id=&quot;textColor&quot; onchange=&quot;changeTextColor(this.value)&quot;\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;#ffffff&quot;\&gt;Putih Bersih\&lt;/option\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;#f1c40f&quot;\&gt;Emas / Kuning\&lt;/option\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;#1c1c1c&quot;\&gt;Hitam Pekat\&lt;/option\&gt;

    \&lt;option value=&quot;#e74c3c&quot;\&gt;Merah Terang\&lt;/option\&gt;

  \&lt;/select\&gt;

\&lt;/div\&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>
<p>&lt;script&gt;</p>
<p>// Fungsi untuk mengganti warna dasar kaos melalui masker CSS</p>
<p>function changeColor(color, button) {</p>
<pre><code>document.getElementById('shirtBase').style.backgroundColor = color;



// Memperbarui status tombol aktif

const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.color-btn');

buttons.forEach(btn =\&gt; btn.classList.remove('active'));

button.classList.add('active');
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>// Fungsi dinamis untuk memperbarui konten teks pada kaos</p>
<p>function updateText(text) {</p>
<pre><code>document.getElementById('designText').innerText = text || &quot;BRAVE&quot;;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<pre><code>button.classList.add('active');
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>
<p>// Fungsi dinamis untuk memperbarui konten teks pada kaos</p>
<p>function updateText(text) {</p>
<pre><code>document.getElementById('designText').innerText = text || &quot;BRAVE&quot;;
</code></pre>
<p>}</p>

Q: Should I be calling DisableNetwork before the OS loses connectivity? A: <p>I can see a flaw in the API design that gives rise to bugs in unsuspecting developers' code. While I can't confirm that <code>Future</code> in the OP is the same as <a href="https://cppreference.com/cpp/thread/future" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>std::future</code></a>, their similarities are visible.
As a result I'd expect any function returning an instance of <code>Future</code> template class declared as undiscardable:</p>
<pre class="lang-cpp prettyprint-override"><code>virtual [[nodiscard(&quot;Avoid instant blockade.&quot;)]] Future&lt;void&gt; DisableNetwork();

virtual [[nodiscard(&quot;Avoid instant blockade.&quot;)]] Future&lt;void&gt; EnableNetwork();
</code></pre>
<p>But I guess the API predates C++17 where the proper attribute was introduced. As a result it's very likely that a naive dev blocks on the <code>Future</code> object by mistake:</p>
<pre class="lang-cpp prettyprint-override"><code>EnableNetwork();//error: block on the returned 'Future'.
</code></pre>
<p>The proper usage that good API(<a href="https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/attributes/nodiscard" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>[[nodiscard]]</code></a>) would enforce, and developer should aquire would be:</p>
<pre class="lang-cpp prettyprint-override"><code>{
    auto&amp;&amp; async_enable = EnableNetwork();
    play_around();
    async_enable.wait();//explicit block;
    auto async_disable = DisableNetwork();
    play_around(some_more);
};  //implicit block by destructor:
    //calls: async_disable.wait();
</code></pre>
<p>The destructor of a <code>std::future</code> blocks(<code>wait()</code>) on the corresponding <code>std::promise</code>, iff it's the sole/last recepient instance of <code>std::future</code>. This is to ensure that the last thread of execution depending on the <code>std::promise</code> performs the proper resource disposal exactly once. Therefore if remaining code relies on the result of requested asynchronous operation, it's best to explicitly call a blocking function (<code>wait</code>, or<code>get</code>).</p>
